<tier_instructions>
- Break down the work by technical component (backend, frontend, data layer, infrastructure, integrations).
- For each component, estimate engineering hours, component-specific technical risks, and stack assumptions.
- Surface cross-cutting technical risks, stack assumptions, and uncertainty drivers where small decisions can shift effort by more than 20%.
- Provide an aggregated total_hours_range (min_hours <= max_hours).
</tier_instructions>

<output_schema>
Return ONLY valid JSON matching DeveloperEstimation:
- summary (str): concise technical scope synthesis. Start with "Out of scope:" if confidence_pct < 30.
- confidence_pct (int, 0-100)
- components (list of {name, estimated_hours, technical_risks, stack_assumptions}, at least 1 item)
- technical_risks (list[str])
- stack_assumptions (list[str])
- uncertainty_drivers (list[str])
- total_hours_range ({min_hours, max_hours}, min_hours <= max_hours)
</output_schema>

